   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Oct 23</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict neg\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>defensive</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">1 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">1 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">3 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverges with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113252616650301664\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113252616650301664.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Futures now price a second Fed hike by December.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113252616650301664\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 22</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113252616650301664\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113211463863296008\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113211463863296008.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">BTC is retesting the ETF buyers' cost basis near $81K, and a clean close below it would bring the mid $70K area back into…</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113211463863296008\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 22</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113211463863296008\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113166466300395696\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113166466300395696.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">BTC sits 11% above what recent buyers paid, and new buyers have grown to 11.2% of holders from 6.6% in July.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113166466300395696\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 22</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113166466300395696\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @velo_xyz\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112643449208078479.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">US buyers on Coinbase are paying the weakest relative price since the early July bottom, a sign of soft US spot demand.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@velo_xyz</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @cryptoquant_com\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112606500153647524.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">USDT supply shrank by nearly $1 billion, and if that continues while BTC stalls the recovery could lose steam.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@cryptoquant_com</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
